id: date/zone-text/0001
area: date
op: Date.prototype.toString, the zone's form
in: str:"2021, 0, 15, 12"
out: value: bool:true
class: normative
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-timezoneestring spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-date.prototype.tostring ref:dateref@1
script: / GMT[+-][0-9]{4}( \(.+\))?$/.test(new Date(2021, 0, 15, 12).toString())
note: TimeZoneString's sign is U+002B or U+002D and its name optional, in every zone (correspondence row R3)
since: 14

